            "pk": "17975020943752294",
            "text": "🇺🇸 THE PATH CHOSEN BY THE STRONGEST!\n\nAstana Hub together with IT PARK Uzbekistan invites you to the legendary acceleration program for founders from Central Asia — right in the heart of Silicon Valley.\n\nWhat awaits you:\n✅ Intensive workshops and lectures from entrepreneurs, investors, and experts\n🔥 Survival Week — a week of challenges to test your leadership and resilience\n🤝 Networking with venture investors, clients, and partners\n📈 Preparation for scaling your business to the US market\n\n🌟 This year, 10 top founders from Central Asia will spend 5 weeks in Silicon Valley, surrounded by investors, mentors, and the global startup community.\n\n💸 Upon completion of the program, Astana Hub Ventures and IT Park Ventures will consider graduates for potential investment in their projects.\n\n❗️ Participation is paid.\n⏳ Application deadline — August 13.\n🔗 Register via the link in profile, under “Programs”.\n🌐 Learn more at astanahub.com"
